B→C: 0*c_x = 0  
C→E: 42*20 = 840  
E→M: 0*(2c_x/7 - 4)=0  
M→A: 12*0 = 0  
Sum2 = 240 - 30c_x/7 - 840 + 840 = 240 - 30c_x/7.

So Sum1 - Sum2 = (1416 - 30c_x/7) - (240 - 30c_x/7) = 1416 - 240 = 1176.  
Area = |1176|/2 = 588.

