Lithium normally has 3 protons and 4 neutrons (⁷Li) or 3 protons and 3 neutrons (⁶Li). "Li with 3 neutrons" means total neutrons = 3, so it's ⁶Li (3 protons, 3 neutrons).  

Mass of ⁶Li:  
