- 3 neutrons: 3 × 1.008665 u = 3.025995 u  
Total = 6.047823 u, but actual atomic mass of ⁶Li is about 6.015 u (binding energy reduces it).  
Better: known mass of ⁶Li = 6.015122 u (from data).  

We need speed v = 0.96c.  
