\[
\gamma = \frac{1}{\sqrt{1 - v^2/c^2}} = \frac{1}{\sqrt{1 - 0.96^2}} = \frac{1}{\sqrt{1 - 0.9216}} = \frac{1}{\sqrt{0.0784}} = \frac{1}{0.28} \approx 3.57142857
\]  
Mass energy of ⁶Li:  
\[
m c^2 = 6.015122 \, \text{u} \times 931.494 \, \text{MeV/u} \approx 5602.0 \, \text{MeV} \quad (\text{more precisely: } 6.015122 \times 931.494 = 5602.0?)
\]  
