Area condition: area(DGF) = area(CHG).

Compute area using coordinates.

Area(DGF): vertices D(0,12), G(-5,b), F(5,b).  
Base GF horizontal length = 10, height from D to line GF: GF is y=b, D y=12, vertical distance = 12-b. So area = (1/2)*10*(12-b) = 5(12-b).

Area(CHG): vertices C(-24,0), H(-5,-b), G(-5,b).  
