Plug into circle: (2b)² + b² = 36 → 4b²+b²=5b²=36 → b²=36/5 → b = 6/√5, a=12/√5.

Area rectangle = (2a)(2b)=4ab = 4*(12/√5)*(6/√5)=4*72/5=288/5.

So m=288, n=5, relatively prime. m+n=293.

