**Step 6 – Check conditions**

C closer to GH: GH at x=-a = -12/√5 ≈ -5.366, C at -24, distance ≈ 18.634; EF at x=12/√5≈5.366, distance ≈29.366, so yes.  
D closer to FG: FG at y=b=6/√5≈2.683, D at 12, distance ≈9.317; EH at y=-2.683, distance ≈14.683, yes.

Triangles equal area: a(12-b)= (12/√5)*(12-6/√5) = (12/√5)*((12√5-6)/√5)=12(12√5-6)/5. b(24-a)= (6/√5)*(24-12/√5)= (6/√5)*((24√5-12)/√5)=6(24√5-12)/5. Check equality: 12(12√5-6)=144√5-72; 6(24√5-12)=144√5-72. Yes.

