\]  
Cancel \(8\sqrt3 x\) on left with \(2\sqrt3 x\) on right? Wait careful: Right side is \(2\sqrt3 x + 2x^2 + 8\).  
So bring all terms:  
\[
3x^4 - 23x^2 - 2\sqrt3 x^3 + 8\sqrt3 x + 48 - 2\sqrt3 x - 2x^2 - 8 = 0.
\]  
Simplify:  
\(8\sqrt3 x - 2\sqrt3 x = 6\sqrt3 x\).  
\(-23x^2 - 2x^2 = -25x^2\).  
\(48 - 8 = 40\).  
So:  
\[
